 "title": "Register of Deeds | Wayne County, NE",
 "text": "Register of Deeds | Wayne County, NE\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nSearch\nAbout Us\nCommissioners\nCounty Offices\nCourt System\nServices\nHome\nCounty Offices\nRegister of Deeds\nRegister of Deeds\nOverview\nThe Register of Deeds office contains grantor, grantee and real estate indexes dating back to the original land patents. Copies of filed documents are available upon request. Pursuant to Nebraska State Statute 32-518 , the County Clerk in Wayne County also performs the duties assigned to the Register of Deeds.\nResponsibilities\nThe Register of Deeds is responsible for:\n23-1503.01 - Instrument submitted for recording; requirements\nDocumentary Stamps\nFee Schedule\nHistorical Records\nNebraska Deeds Online\nE Recording - Simplifile (Filings NOT viewed or processed after 4:00 p.m.)\nE Recording - CSC\nContact Us\nRegister of Deeds\nEmail Register of Deeds\nPhysical Address\n510 Pearl Street\nSuite 5\nWayne , NE 68787\nPhone: (402) 375-2288\nFax: (402) 375-4137\nHours\nMonday through Friday\n8:30 a.m. to 5 p.m.\nDirectory\nQuick Links\nDeed Search\nCounty Court\nDrivers Licenses\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nDocumentary Stamps\nFee Schedule\nHistorical Records\nNumerical Indexes\nGIS Maps\nContact Us\nEmergency Alerts\nQuick Links\nInfo Advanced\nWayne County\n510 Pearl Street\nWayne, NE 68787\nFax: 402-375-4137\nCourthouse Hours:\nMonday - Friday\n8:30 a.m. to 5:00 p.m.\nQuick Links\nCounty Court\nDeeds on Line\nDrivers License\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nSocial Media\nNebraska Extension in Wayne County\nWayne County Assessor's Office\nWayne County Sheriff's Office\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nHelpful Links\nHome\nContact Us\nCopyright Notices\nAccessibility\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\n<---- Start TextMyGov---->\n&placement=right&parentOrigin=https://waynecountyne.gov&mobile=0\" style=\"width: 255px; height: 276.484px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; position: fixed; right: 20px; left: unset; bottom: 60px; z-index: 10000;\">\nClose ×",
